# Goblin Surveyor (3/2 trample, Start your engines!): "Max speed — {3}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Draw a card" (CR 702.178a/b:
# the ability functions from the graveyard only at max speed). Bot1 casts two Surveyors on turn 1 (speed 1); Bot2 bolts one of them on
# turn 2, leaving it in Bot1's graveyard. The other attacks into an empty board on turns 3, 5, 7, raising speed to 2, 3, 4 (CR 702.179d).
# At speed 3 (one short of max) with exactly the three mana available the graveyard ability is refused; at speed 4 it is allowed, and it
# exiles the card as a cost and draws one: Bot1's hand 4 -> 5, and Bot2 took 3 a turn (20 - 9 = 11). The ability works only from the
# graveyard: the Surveyor on the battlefield cannot activate it, even at max speed.

